OCGRAPH 1
DOMAIN gameplay
# THE CONCRETE PLAYER CONTROLLER. The engine's built-in PlayerController is abstract and cannot be spawned, and begin_play
# possesses a pawn only when it has both. Input is polled by the pawn itself, so nothing else belongs here (AN_FPController.ocgraph in the
# FirstPerson template has the full story).
NAME VehicleController
DESCRIPTION The player controller. Empty on purpose: it exists so the game mode has something concrete to possess with.

CLASS AN_VehicleController PlayerController

